liminary as investigations into crashes can take up to 1 year to finalise.\r\n\u2022\tProperty damage only crashes ceased to be reported/recorded by Queensland Police Service after 31 December 2010.\r\n\u2022\tThese crash location coordinates reference the current Australian geodetic datum is GDA2020 (previously it was GDA94).\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nReportable data status\r\nThe Department of Transport and Main Roads (TMR) is able to provide full characteristics and details (including contributing factors) of Queensland crash data for:\r\n\u2022\tFatal crashes to 31 October 2025.\r\n\u2022\tNon-fatal casualty crashes to 31 July 2025.\r\n", "num_resources": 6, "num_tags": 15, "organization": {"id": "d540ffc8-b2e7-4e49-814a-5237f14a1ae9", "name": "transport-and-main-roads", "title": "Transport and Main Roads", "type": "organization", "description": "", "image_url": "", "created": "2013-08-14T23:20:45.690172", "is_organization": true, "approval_status": "approved", "state": "active"}, "owner_org": "d540ffc8-b2e7-4e49-814a-5237f14a1ae9", "private": false, "schema_json": "", "schema_upload": "", "schema_url": "", "security_classification": "PUBLIC", "state": "active", "title": "Crash data from Queensland roads", "type": "dataset", "update_frequency": "non-regular", "url": "", "version": "rqC45037- June 2025", "groups": [{"description": "", "display_name": "Transportation", "id": "82cb68ff-c621-4837-978b-891a4239a630", "image_display_url": "", "name": "transportation", "title": "Transportation"}], "resources": [{"_do_not_validate": true, "align_default_schema": false, "archiver": {"resource_timestamp": "2021-11-03T04:40:43.661267", "status_id": 0, "is_broken": false, "reason": "", "url_redirected_to": "https://www.data.qld.gov.au/dataset/f3e0ca94-2d7b-44ee-abef-d6b06e9b0729/resource/e88943c0-5968-4972-a15f-38e120d72ec0/download/2024_1_crash_locations.csv", "cache_filepath": "resources/e88943c0-5968-4972-a15f-38e120d72ec0